# Archived gate logs and their manifest are evidence: checkout must not rewrite
# their bytes (core.autocrlf=true on this host would otherwise turn LF into
# CRLF and make logs.sha256 fail against its own files).
evidence/viewmodel/range/logs/** -text
# core.autocrlf=true is on for this checkout, and it would rewrite the evidence
# here on checkout: every line of artifacts.sha256 is `sha256 *<path>`, so a
# trailing CR becomes part of the filename, and the .txt/.json/.csv extracts would
# come back with different bytes than the ones that were hashed. Both failures
# appear in exactly the situation the receipt exists for -- a fresh clone -- so
# this directory is checked out byte for byte.
evidence/weapon-material/** -text
